infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Auto vs manual: breadth for free, depth where it counts
  desc Auto covers most traffic but only what happened; the small manual slice explains why
  compares
    - label Auto-instrumentation
      children
        - label 70-80% of traffic, for free
          desc HTTP, DB, queues, caches — no code changes
        - label Answers what happened
          desc 800 ms, 5 DB queries
        - label Zero-code: agent or monkey-patch
          desc Platform owns the SDK wrapper
    - label Manual spans
      children
        - label 20-30% of traffic, hand-written
          desc Business operations the framework cannot see
        - label Answers why it was slow
          desc Fraud loop fanned out to 12 calls, 3 timed out
        - label Typed attributes + span events
          desc App teams own the business spans
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6
